      "text": "Ansätt f(x) = x^2 + bx"
    },
    {
      "text": "f'(x) = 2x + b"
    },
    {
      "text": "f'(3) = 2 · 3 + b = 6 + b = 2"
    },
    {
      "text": "b = 2 − 6 = -4"
    },
    {
      "text": "f(x) = x^2 - 4x",
